## Testing Changes

```bash
# 1. Clean build
./scripts/build_app.sh Debug

# 2. Install and test
./scripts/build_app.sh Debug --install --launch

# 3. Check logs
tail -f /tmp/alttab_perf.log  # Performance logs (DEBUG only)
cat logs/build_*.log | tail -100  # Most recent build log
```

## File Locations

- **Build output**: `~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/alt-tab-macos-*/Build/Products/`
- **Build logs**: `logs/build_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.log` (timestamped, git-ignored)
- **Performance logs**: `/tmp/alttab_perf.log` (DEBUG only)
- **Installed app**: `/Applications/AltTab.app`
